message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the associated article and this repository."
title: "A Metaheuristic Feature Selection Framework for Short-Form Stakeholder Segmentation in Agri-Food Supply Chains: code and de-identified data"
abstract: "Code, de-identified survey data and numeric outputs that reproduce every figure and numerical table of the article. A Tabu Search selects a short form of a 40-item stakeholder survey (42 respondents, seven Geographical-Indication and organic agri-food pilot value chains) that preserves the four-profile segmentation obtained from the full instrument with PCA and Ward clustering."
